From e67d59aad0ce4d3e13aed27defe93536aeebbc53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Season Tempo Build <claude@seasontempo.local>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 18:56:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Mobile mutation reliability: no action may appear to do
 nothing

Two production failures. Make inactive SUCCEEDED and the drawer kept showing
Active, because nothing told the open surface to take the persisted state.
Remove from roster FAILED silently, because window.confirm() returns false when
a mobile browser suppresses dialogs and the error rendered at page level,
underneath a fixed full-height drawer where it could not be seen.

  useMutation      pending, await, and a route refresh on success
  ConfirmAction    in-app confirmation; no native dialog gates a mutation
  Errors           render in the surface that acted, not beneath it

Every destructive action across Team, Contacts, Finance, Facilities, Settings,
Tournaments, Files, Games and Branding now confirms in the page. Runners that
already synchronised correctly were left alone rather than standardised for
its own sake.
